ers.error\":\"Tournament Display Name can only contain latin letters, numbers, spaces, and underscores.\",\"player.leave.description\":\"Are you sure you want to leave? You can always register for your Compete Card later if you choose.\",\"player.lengthRequired.error\":\"Tournament Display Name must be between {minDisplayNameLength} and {maxDisplayNameLength} characters.\",\"player.name.description\":\"This is how you will show up to other players in-game and on broadcast/streams during tournaments. You will receive tournament credentials which include the name and password on your Compete Card once they have been approved and issued. Please note that Tournament Realm Display Names are subject to approval and availability.\",\"player.oopsSomethingsWrong\":\"Oops! Something's wrong\",\"player.profile.action.edit\":\"Edit profile\",\"player.profile.completed.description\":\"Your competitor profile is complete.\",\"player.profile.completion.progress\":\"Step {step} of {total}\",\"player.profile.create.title\":\"Create competitor profile\",\"player.profile.discord.placeholder\":\"Ex: Tactigu#7777\",\"player.profile.name.description\":\"Depending on availability, you may be asked to update your name at a later time.\",\"player.profile.name.label\":\"Display name\",\"player.profile.name.placeholder\":\"Name\",\"player.profile.name.preferred.label\":\"Preferred display name\",\"player.profile.name.title\":\"Request a display name\",\"player.profile.region.label\":\"Home region\",\"player.profile.region.title\":\"Acknowledge your region\",\"player.profile.review.title\":\"Review your profile\",\"player.profile.terms.accept\":\"I have read and agree to the above terms\",\"player.profile.update.unavailable\":\"Unable to update player at this time. Please try again later.\",\"player.region.description\":\"This is the region and shard you’ll be competing in, which we’ve pulled from your Riot player account.\\n\\nWhen registering for events, you'll be registering for this region's tournaments only. When competiting for tournament spots via qualification paths like the ranked ladder, you'll be competing with other players on the same shard. Some regional tournaments hold a specific number of spots for each shard, so make sure to check out each event's page for more information.\",\"player.region.title\":\"Your Region\",\"player.region.yourRegion\":\"Your Region:\",\"player.register.description\":\"Join the fight and register to compete in this event\\n\\nRegistration will be open to all players with a Compete Card through {date}. Once registered, players must compete to qualify into this event.\",\"player.register.done.description\":\"You're registered for {tournamentName}. Now it's time to qualify...\\n\\nFor next steps, please refer to the How to Qualify section of the {tournamentName} Qualification page in order to find out how to qualify into this tournament - this page will be your one-stop shop for all qualification information.\\n\\nYou're ready, Tactician! We'll see you on the Convergence.\",\"player.register.error.invalidShard.description\":\"You cannot register for this tournament. Competitors can only register for tournaments within their own region. Please reference your Compete Card to find your region.\",\"player.register.error.invalidShard.title\":\"Invalid Shard\",\"player.register.terms.age\":\"I confirm that I am at least 18 years of age on {date}\",\"player.register.terms.description\":\"Read the Rules agreement and confirm the age consent below to register for this event\",\"player.register.terms.title\":\"{tournamentName} Registration\",\"player.registerForEvent\":\"Register for Event\",\"player.registerMyCard\":\"Register My Card\",\"player.requestTournamentDisplayName\":\"Request Tournament Display Name\",\"player.review.description\":\"You're almost there!\\n\\nPlease make sure all of the information looks correct before registering your Compete Card. If everything looks good, hit Register My Card below to start your