e\":\"Third Place\",\"thousandAbbr\":\"K\",\"tickets.anEmailWasSentConfirmingYourRegistration\":\"An email was sent confirming your registration.\",\"tickets.arenaStage\":\"Arena Stage\",\"tickets.closed.description\":\"The window for {eventName} ticket eligibility has closed.\",\"tickets.closed.windowVctChampions.description\":\"The window for VCT Champions 2025 ticket eligibility has closed.\",\"tickets.complete.codeExpiry.body\":\"CRITICAL: Access codes expire 24 hours after the ticket sale goes live, so be ready to act quick!\",\"tickets.complete.purchaseWindow.duration\":\"You will have 24 hours to complete your purchase.\",\"tickets.complete.purchaseWindow.expiry.body\":\"Once your ticket purchase window has closed, you will no longer have access to the Fan First Access sale.\",\"tickets.complete.purchaseWindow.notice.body\":\"Pay close attention to when your ticket purchase window is active.\",\"tickets.complete.saleDate\":\"Tickets sales will go live on {date}.\",\"tickets.complete.ticketmasterEmailMatch.description\":\"For Swiss, Quarterfinals, Semifinals, and Finals tickets, your Ticketmaster account email address MUST match your Riot Games account email address in order to complete ticket purchase.\",\"tickets.complete.verification.body\":\"If the account is verified, you will receive a one-time use access code and a link to a private sales page.\",\"tickets.complete.verification.description\":\"If your account is verified you will receive an email with a one-time use access code and instructions on how to complete your ticket purchase via Ticketmaster for {eventName} tickets.\",\"tickets.earlyAccess\":\"EARLY ACCESS\",\"tickets.earlyAccess.description\":\"Early access may be granted to Riot Accounts that demonstrate more in-game engagement via game hours played or content purchased\",\"tickets.eligibilityWindow.closed\":\"Eligibility window closed\",\"tickets.emailMeAboutOtherRiotGamesNews\":\"Email me about other Riot Games news\",\"tickets.eventName.worlds_2026\":\"Worlds 2026\",\"tickets.fanFirstAccess\":\"Fan First Access\",\"tickets.followUp.description\":\"If the account is verified, in July, you will receive emails from Riot with a one-time use access code and a link to a private sales page. Emails will be sent in waves, so they will not be received immediately after registering.\",\"tickets.groupsBracketStage\":\"Groups + Bracket Stage\",\"tickets.importantNextSteps\":\"IMPORTANT NEXT STEPS\",\"tickets.limit.description\":\"Each Riot account may purchase up to 4 tickets for {eventName}\",\"tickets.limit.purchaseLimit.perShowDay.description\":\"Each Riot account may purchase up to 4 tickets per show day for {eventName}\",\"tickets.preferredDates\":\"PREFERRED DATES\",\"tickets.preopen.checkBack\":\"Please check back on {registrationOpenDate} for more details on {eventName} ticket eligibility.\",\"tickets.preopen.comingSoon.title\":\"COMING SOON\",\"tickets.privacyNotice\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"tickets.registerCallout.description\":\"Registration is required to determine your eligibility for Fan First ticket access. It does not guarantee access to tickets.\",\"tickets.registration.confirm.modal.prompt\":\"Are these the dates that you’re interested in?\",\"tickets.registration.confirmDates.note\":\"Please note: Your selection is not a guarantee of tickets.\",\"tickets.registration.description\":\"When you click “submit”, you will be registered for fan ticketing eligibility verification. Your email will be used to validate your Riot Games account, including validation of in-game behavior, delivery of ticketing access codes, and sending communications about the Worlds 2026 event. To ensure only eligible accounts can purchase tickets, Riot will share your email address, if eligible, with our third party ticketing partners (Ticketmaster and/or Tixr). Your account information may also be stored and used for other Riot Games events ticketing opportunities. For more details on how Riot Games processes your personal in