 in the local region you will compete in\",\"vct.eligibility.outOfRegionRequirements\":\"Maximum of 2 players outside of the region you will compete in\",\"vct.eligibility.peakRankRequirements\":\"All players must have a minimum peak rank of Ascendant (in the last 6 months)\",\"vct.eligibility.sharedRegion.description\":\"Eligibility is determined by having at least 3 starters in a shared region.\",\"vct.eligibility.sharedRegion.example\":\"Example: if you wanted to compete in North America, you would need a roster of 5 starters, and at least 3 of those starters must have Riot accounts associated with North America.\",\"vct.eligibility.starterRequirements\":\"5 starters\",\"vct.eligibility.teamComposition.description\":\"Depending on the makeup of your team, this can impact which opens you’re eligible to compete in.\",\"vct.events.description\":\"Explore live, upcoming and concluded VALORANT events and qualifiers in each region.\",\"vct.events.title\":\"VALORANT events\",\"vct.kickoff.action.viewSeasonEvent\":\"View event: VCT Kickoff {year} in the season overview\",\"vct.kickoff.partnerTeamsReturn.title\":\"Partner Teams Will Return for VCT Kickoff {year}!\",\"vct.openQualifiers.action.register\":\"Register for an open qualifier\",\"vct.openQualifiers.action.registerTeam\":\"Register for an open qualifier event with a team\",\"vct.openQualifiers.announcement\":\"Open qualifiers are here for {seasonName}!\",\"vct.openQualifiers.kickoff.title\":\"Kickoff open qualifiers\",\"vct.openQualifiers.opens.title\":\"Opens\",\"vct.openQualifiers.recommendations.description\":\"You’ll also get recommended open qualifiers\",\"vct.openQualifiers.region.label\":\"Open qualifiers in your region\",\"vct.openQualifiers.regionDetails.comingSoon\":\"Open qualifier details for {region} are coming soon.\",\"vct.openQualifiers.regionalEvents.loading\":\"Loading events for your region\",\"vct.openQualifiers.regionalRecommendations.unavailable\":\"We couldn’t find events for your region. R